subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Manage free trials

USAGE:
  subtrack [COMMANDS] <OPTIONS>

COMMANDS:
  [trial] <OPTIONS>          Manage free trials
  add <OPTIONS>              Add a free trial
  delete <OPTIONS>           Delete free trials
  expiring <OPTIONS>         Show trials expiring within a number of days
  list <OPTIONS>             List all free trials

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  subtrack trial --help
  subtrack trial add --help
  subtrack trial delete --help
  subtrack trial expiring --help
  subtrack trial list --help

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version

